{
  "name": "Commerce Paytrail",
  "data_name": "commerce_paytrail",
  "description": "Off-site Drupal Commerce payment gateway for Paytrail (Finnish payment aggregator: banks, cards, mobile methods). Provides redirect (paytrail) and tokenized-card (paytrail_token) gateway plugins with refunds, voids and authorizations, built on the paytrail/paytrail-php-sdk library. EUR only. Recomputes the Paytrail HMAC signature server-side on the return/notify callback and re-fetches payment status from Paytrail's authenticated API before marking an order paid.",
